  "name": "Tipsy Balance",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/weapons/polearms/spear-flared-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 6th level, you gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>As an attack action, you can make a single melee attack against any number of creatures within melee range of you, with a separate attack roll for each target.</li>\n<li>When you're prone, you can stand up by spending 5 feet of movement, rather than half your speed.</li>\n<li>When a creature misses you with a melee attack roll, you can use your reaction to cause that attack to hit one creature of your choice, other than the attacker, that you can see within the attacker's melee range.</li>\n</ul>",
